### 5.2 Proposed Mean-Centered Generators

Anodized:

    h = 0.5 + (ch0 - m0) * 0.38

    rMod = 0.5 + (ch1 - m1) * 0.55

    cavityAo = 0.90 + (ch2 - m2) * 0.50

    albedo = clamp(
        0.0405 + (h - 0.5) * 0.018,
        0.034,
        0.048
    )

    rough = clamp(
        0.38 + (rMod - 0.5) * 0.08,
        0.34,
        0.42
    )

    ao = clamp(
        0.90 + (cavityAo - 0.5) * 0.14,
        0.82,
        1.0
    )

